    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَيْرُ طَيْرُ</span>, (O,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَيْرِ طَيْرِ</span>,
